https://www.dewalt.com/product/dcb518,https://www.dewalt.com/product/dcb518,https://anchors.dewalt.com/anchors/_documents/uploads/_msds_reports/NA_Lithium_Ion_Battery_Packs_PDS_Rev_6.13.pdf?1686861129,,,,DCB518ASTS06G,Industrial & Commercial,Equipment & Supplies,General,DCB518ASTS06G,DCB518ASTS06G,DEWALT 20V MAX XR FLEXVOLT 6.0AH BATTERY,,,,DeWalt,DeWalt Industrial,DEWALT,,DCB518ASTS06G,,Industrial & Commercial>Equipment & Supplies>General,"* DEWALT 20V MAX XR FLEXVOLT 6.0Ah Battery
* Powers both 20V MAX and 60V MAX tools
* Extended runtime for increased productivity",DEWALT 20V/60V FLEXVOLT 6.0AH BATTERY,DEWALT 20V MAX XR FLEXVOLT Battery 6.0Ah,"The DEWALT 20V MAX XR FLEXVOLT 6.0Ah Battery is a revolutionary power solution designed to maximize the performance of your DEWALT tools. Featuring advanced Lithium-Ion technology, this battery provides exceptional runtime and durability for demanding job site applications. Its unique FLEXVOLT technology allows it to automatically change voltage when you switch between 20V MAX and 60V MAX tools, offering unparalleled versatility. Experience the power of XR extended runtime, enabling you to work longer with fewer battery changes. This 6.0Ah battery is an essential upgrade for professionals seeking reliable, high-capacity power for their entire DEWALT cordless system.","Engineered for peak performance, the DEWALT DCB518ASTS06G is a 20V MAX XR FLEXVOLT 6.0Ah Lithium-Ion battery pack. This innovative battery seamlessly adapts its voltage output, operating at 20V MAX for a wide range of DEWALT cordless tools and automatically switching to 60V MAX when paired with FLEXVOLT tools for heavy-duty applications. The XR designation signifies extended runtime, providing users with increased productivity and reduced downtime. Its robust construction ensures resilience in harsh working environments, while the 6.0Ah capacity offers substantial power for prolonged use. This battery is a cornerstone of the DEWALT 20V/60V MAX system, delivering consistent and reliable power.","Unleash the full potential of your DEWALT tools with the game-changing 20V MAX XR FLEXVOLT 6.0Ah Battery! Experience the freedom of a battery that powers both your 20V MAX and 60V MAX tools, adapting instantly to your needs. Get more done with XR extended runtime and conquer any job with unwavering power and versatility.",FLEXVOLT technology automatically changes voltage when switching tools.,Compatible with both 20V MAX and 60V MAX DEWALT tools.,6.0Ah capacity provides significant extended runtime for demanding tasks.,XR Lithium-Ion technology for enhanced power and durability.,Powers a wide range of DEWALT cordless power tools.,Ideal for demanding professional job site applications.,Robust construction designed for harsh working environments.,Minimizes downtime with fewer battery changes required.,Offers versatility across multiple DEWALT tool platforms.,High-capacity cells deliver consistent and reliable power output.,Quick charge capability when paired with DEWALT fast chargers.,Integrated LED fuel gauge for convenient charge status monitoring.,Lightweight design helps reduce user fatigue during prolonged operation.,Advanced thermal management system prevents overheating for longer life.,Impact-resistant housing protects against drops and job site impacts.,"Optimized for heavy-duty cutting, grinding, and drilling applications.",Provides maximum power for high-draw tools and accessories.,Essential component for a complete DEWALT cordless tool system.,Unmatched Versatility: Powers both 20V MAX and 60V MAX tools seamlessly.,Extended Runtime: 6.0Ah capacity for longer work sessions and increased productivity.,,"UL Listed, CSA Certified, RoHS Compliant",Yes,"Ideal for professional contractors and DIY enthusiasts requiring extended runtime and versatile power for a wide range of DEWALT 20V MAX and 60V MAX cordless power tools. Suitable for demanding applications in construction, woodworking, and general maintenance.",(1) DEWALT 20V MAX XR FLEXVOLT 6.0Ah Battery,DEWALT 20V MAX XR FLEXVOLT 6.0AH BATTERY,Battery Type,Lithium-Ion,,Amp Hour,6.0,Ah,Technology,XR FLEXVOLT,,Product Type,Power Tool Battery,,Chemistry,Li-Ion,,Compatibility,DEWALT 20V MAX and 60V MAX Tools,,Rechargeable,Yes,,Color,Yellow/Black,,Charge Indicator,Fuel Gauge,,Battery Series,FLEXVOLT XR,,Energy Capacity (20V),120,Wh,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,27112703,"3 Year Limited Warranty, 1 Year Free Service, 90 Day Money Back Guarantee",149.99,,,,5.5,in,2.8,in,3.2,in,2.2,lbs,,,https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-wlbjjbyoi5/images/stencil/1200w/products/872201/898498/DeWALT_DCB115__63027.1756154693.jpg?compression=lossy,,,,,,,,,https://anchors.dewalt.com/anchors/_documents/uploads/_msds_reports/NA_Lithium_Ion_Battery_Packs_PDS_Rev_6.13.pdf?1686861129,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,No,Yes
